326 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 187 0 R
/T (In order to retrive unreleased products, either we need to remove the AND release = 1 condition from the SQL query or set it to AND released = 0 to only retrive unreleased products. While we cannot directly modify the SQL query condition that prevents the server from sending unreleased products, we can still use SQL comments to comment that out, thus making it without effect.)
